Package: psyWiz
Type: Package
Title: Psychometric Wizardry: Tools for Psychometric Analysis and Visualization
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Herman", "Elgueta", email = "herman.elgueta@umag.cl", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6764-5490"))
Description: Tools for confirmatory factor analysis and structural equation
    modeling built on 'lavaan', usable from R and as a 'jamovi' module. Features
    native ordinal item handling (WLSMV), measurement invariance testing across
    groups step by step with guided verdicts, score tests for worst-fitting
    constraints, automated partial invariance, latent mean comparisons with
    forest plots, bifactor modeling with hierarchical omega and explained common
    variance, multi-estimator evaluations, exploratory structural equation
    modeling (ESEM) with target rotation, and novel variance-proportional
    visualizations (Comb, Antenna, and Brush plots) with optional model fit
    printing.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/heelgueta/psywiz
BugReports: https://github.com/heelgueta/psywiz/issues
